# Shallow Grave puts the creature onto the battlefield without casting it, so Bot2's Containment Priest ("if a nontoken
# creature would enter and it wasn't cast, exile it instead") exiles it. On turn 2 Bot2 casts the Priest and Bolts Bot1's
# Llanowar Elves; on turn 3 Shallow Grave tries to return the Elves and they are exiled instead: they never reach the
# battlefield, so there is no haste and nothing for the end step to do.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Llanowar Elves
Shallow Grave
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
